msgstr "Obtener ajustes sociales de la entrada"

#: src/Actions/Abilities/AbilitiesApi.php:268
msgid "Retrieve the social (Facebook/Open Graph and X/Twitter) title, description and image metadata of a post."
msgstr "Recuperar los metadatos sociales (Facebook/Open Graph y X/Twitter) de título, descripción e imagen de una entrada."

#: src/Actions/Abilities/AbilitiesApi.php:273
msgid "List of social settings as { key, value } entries."
msgstr "Lista de ajustes sociales como entradas { clave, valor }."

#: src/Actions/Abilities/AbilitiesApi.php:297
msgid "Update post social settings"
msgstr "Actualizar ajustes sociales de la entrada"

#: src/Actions/Abilities/AbilitiesApi.php:298
